 Local Python example. No dependency installation is needed.
-No test runner is configured in this checkout.
+Run the local regression tests with the Python standard library:
+
+```sh
+PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 -m unittest discover -v
+```
+
+EUR is recognized in `SUPPORTED_CURRENCIES`, but remains disabled in
+`ENABLED_CURRENCIES`. The ledger's existing settlement contract accepts USD only.
+It now rejects other currencies before adding an entry, including calls that
+bypass checkout or accidentally enable EUR in checkout configuration.
+
+Euro settlement is not implemented. Enabling EUR requires a verified settlement
+contract that preserves EUR amounts and currency through its consumers, plus
+independent review of the monetary change. This checkout does not contain that
+settlement integration or its contract tests; changing the stored currency label
+alone does not verify euro settlement. No currency conversion is performed.
